<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Calpine upped to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Calpine upped to strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Mike Worms upgraded Calpine Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-3/8 18-5/8.</p>
